            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वाचक — vācak — \"a reader\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "या मासिकाचे हजारो वाचक आहेत. yā māsikāce hajāro vācak āhet. This magazine has thousands of readers."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural वाचक (vācak)."
