          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "वाचक (vācak) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit vācaka, 'speaking, expressing' (Monier-Williams); Marathi uses it for the one who reads, from vācṇe, 'to read'."
            }
          ]
        },
